.TH "cqrs-snapshots-generate" 1 "August 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
cqrs-snapshots-generate \- Scan active CQRS event streams, replay event logs, and generate point-in-time state snapshots for workflow entities to optimize future reconstitution.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php cqrs-snapshots-generate
.SH DESCRIPTION
Scan active CQRS event streams, replay event logs, and generate point-in-time state snapshots for workflow entities to optimize future reconstitution.
